{"seq":3,"slug":"nextjs-app-router","title":"Next.js App Router 应用路由","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-in-depth/server-rendering/nextjs-app-router","wordCount":609,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"next-js-app-router-应用路由\">Next.js App Router 应用路由</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>App Router 是 Next.js 13 引入、基于 React Server Components 构建的文件系统路由。每个路由段都能定义独立的 layout、loading、error 与元数据，把页面结构与异步状态的处理下沉到目录约定中。本章讲解 App Router 的架构、Layout / Page / Loading / Error 的职责、Parallel Routes 的并行渲染、Intercepting Routes 的拦截式导航，以及多层缓存策略。</p>\n<h2 id=\"app-router-架构\">App Router 架构</h2><p>Next.js 13 引入的 <strong>App Router</strong> 基于 React Server Components 构建，使用文件系统路由。每个路由段可以定义独立的布局、加载状态、错误处理和元数据。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;app/&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; B[&quot;layout.tsx (根布局)&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;page.tsx (首页)&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;blog/&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;layout.tsx (博客布局)&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; F[&quot;page.tsx (博客列表)&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; G[[slug]/&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; H[&quot;page.tsx (文章详情)&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; I[&quot;loading.tsx&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; J[&quot;error.tsx&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"app/\"]\n    A --&gt; B[\"layout.tsx (根布局)\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"page.tsx (首页)\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"blog/\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"layout.tsx (博客布局)\"]\n    D --&gt; F[\"page.tsx (博客列表)\"]\n    D --&gt; G[[slug]/\"]\n    G --&gt; H[\"page.tsx (文章详情)\"]\n    G --&gt; I[\"loading.tsx\"]\n    G --&gt; J[\"error.tsx\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"layout-page-loading-error\">Layout / Page / Loading / Error</h2><h3 id=\"layout\">Layout</h3><p>Layout 在路由切换时不重新渲染，保持状态。根布局必须包含 <code>&lt;html&gt;</code> 和 <code>&lt;body&gt;</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"// app/layout.tsx&#10;export default function RootLayout({ children }: { children: React.ReactNode }) {&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;html lang=&quot;zh-CN&quot;&gt;&#10;      &lt;body&gt;&#10;        &lt;nav&gt;&#10;          &lt;Link href=&quot;/&quot;&gt;首页&lt;/Link&gt;&#10;          &lt;Link href=&quot;/blog&quot;&gt;博客&lt;/Link&gt;&#10;          &lt;Link href=&quot;/about&quot;&gt;关于&lt;/Link&gt;&#10;        &lt;/nav&gt;&#10;        &lt;main&gt;{children}&lt;/main&gt;&#10;      &lt;/body&gt;&#10;    &lt;/html&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}&#10;&#10;// app/blog/layout.tsx&#10;export default function BlogLayout({ children }: { children: React.ReactNode }) {&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;div className=&quot;blog-layout&quot;&gt;&#10;      &lt;aside&gt;&#10;        &lt;BlogSidebar /&gt;&#10;      &lt;/aside&gt;&#10;      &lt;section&gt;{children}&lt;/section&gt;&#10;    &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// app/layout.tsx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export default function RootLayout({ children }: { children: React.ReactNode }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;html lang=\"zh-CN\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;body></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;nav></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          &#x3C;Link href=\"/\">首页&#x3C;/Link></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          &#x3C;Link href=\"/blog\">博客&#x3C;/Link></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          &#x3C;Link href=\"/about\">关于&#x3C;/Link></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;/nav></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;main>{children}&#x3C;/main></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/body></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/html></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// app/blog/layout.tsx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export default function BlogLayout({ children }: { children: React.ReactNode }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;div className=\"blog-layout\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;aside></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;BlogSidebar /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/aside></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;section>{children}&#x3C;/section></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"page\">Page</h3><p>每个路由段的 <code>page.tsx</code> 定义该路由的 UI，默认为 Server Component：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"// app/blog/page.tsx&#10;interface Article {&#10;  id: string;&#10;  title: string;&#10;  excerpt: string;&#10;  createdAt: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;export default async function BlogPage() {&#10;  const articles: Article[] = await fetch(&#39;https://api.example.com/articles&#39;, {&#10;    next: { revalidate: 60 },&#10;  }).then((res) =&gt; res.json());&#10;&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;div&gt;&#10;      &lt;h1&gt;博客文章&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;      &lt;ul&gt;&#10;        {articles.map((article) =&gt; (&#10;          &lt;li key={article.id}&gt;&#10;            &lt;Link href={`/blog/${article.id}`}&gt;&#10;              &lt;h2&gt;{article.title}&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;              &lt;p&gt;{article.excerpt}&lt;/p&gt;&#10;            &lt;/Link&gt;&#10;          &lt;/li&gt;&#10;        ))}&#10;      &lt;/ul&gt;&#10;    &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// app/blog/page.tsx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>interface Article {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  id: string;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  title: string;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  excerpt: string;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  createdAt: string;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export default async function BlogPage() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const articles: Article[] = await fetch('https://api.example.com/articles', {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    next: { revalidate: 60 },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }).then((res) => res.json());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;h1>博客文章&#x3C;/h1></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;ul></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {articles.map((article) => (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          &#x3C;li key={article.id}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            &#x3C;Link href={`/blog/${article.id}`}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>              &#x3C;h2>{article.title}&#x3C;/h2></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>              &#x3C;p>{article.excerpt}&#x3C;/p></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            &#x3C;/Link></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          &#x3C;/li></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ))}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/ul></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"loading\">Loading</h3><p><code>loading.tsx</code> 自动包裹在 Suspense 中，在页面数据加载时显示：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"// app/blog/[slug]/loading.tsx&#10;export default function Loading() {&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;div className=&quot;skeleton&quot;&gt;&#10;      &lt;div className=&quot;skeleton-title&quot; /&gt;&#10;      &lt;div className=&quot;skeleton-line&quot; /&gt;&#10;      &lt;div className=&quot;skeleton-line&quot; /&gt;&#10;      &lt;div className=&quot;skeleton-line short&quot; /&gt;&#10;    &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// app/blog/[slug]/loading.tsx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export default function Loading() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;div className=\"skeleton\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;div className=\"skeleton-title\" /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;div className=\"skeleton-line\" /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;div className=\"skeleton-line\" /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;div className=\"skeleton-line short\" /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"error\">Error</h3><p><code>error.tsx</code> 作为错误边界捕获该路由段的错误：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"// app/blog/[slug]/error.tsx&#10;&#39;use client&#39;;&#10;&#10;export default function Error({ error, reset }: { error: Error &amp; { digest?: string }; reset: () =&gt; void }) {&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;div&gt;&#10;      &lt;h2&gt;加载文章出错&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;      &lt;p&gt;{error.message}&lt;/p&gt;&#10;      &lt;button onClick={reset}&gt;重试&lt;/button&gt;&#10;    &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// app/blog/[slug]/error.tsx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>'use client';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export default function Error({ error, reset }: { error: Error &#x26; { digest?: string }; reset: () => void }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;h2>加载文章出错&#x3C;/h2></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;p>{error.message}&#x3C;/p></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;button onClick={reset}>重试&#x3C;/button></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>文件</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>组件类型</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>layout.tsx</code></td>\n<td>共享布局，路由切换不销毁</td>\n<td>Server（默认）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>page.tsx</code></td>\n<td>路由页面内容</td>\n<td>Server（默认）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>loading.tsx</code></td>\n<td>加载骨架屏</td>\n<td>Server（默认）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>error.tsx</code></td>\n<td>错误降级 UI</td>\n<td>Client（必须）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>not-found.tsx</code></td>\n<td>404 页面</td>\n<td>Server（默认）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>template.tsx</code></td>\n<td>类似 layout 但每次重建</td>\n<td>Server（默认）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"parallel-routes\">Parallel Routes</h2><p>并行路由允许在同一布局中同时渲染多个页面，每个 slot 独立加载和导航：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"// app/dashboard/layout.tsx&#10;export default function DashboardLayout({&#10;  children,&#10;  analytics,&#10;  team,&#10;}: {&#10;  children: React.ReactNode;&#10;  analytics: React.ReactNode;&#10;  team: React.ReactNode;&#10;}) {&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;div className=&quot;dashboard&quot;&gt;&#10;      &lt;div className=&quot;main&quot;&gt;{children}&lt;/div&gt;&#10;      &lt;div className=&quot;sidebar&quot;&gt;&#10;        {analytics}&#10;        {team}&#10;      &lt;/div&gt;&#10;    &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// app/dashboard/layout.tsx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export default function DashboardLayout({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  children,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  analytics,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  team,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  children: React.ReactNode;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  analytics: React.ReactNode;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  team: React.ReactNode;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;div className=\"dashboard\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;div className=\"main\">{children}&#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;div className=\"sidebar\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {analytics}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {team}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"app/dashboard/&#10;├── layout.tsx&#10;├── page.tsx&#10;├── @analytics/&#10;│   └── page.tsx&#10;└── @team/&#10;    └── page.tsx\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>app/dashboard/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── layout.tsx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── page.tsx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── @analytics/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── page.tsx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── @team/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    └── page.tsx</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;DashboardLayout&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; B[&quot;children (page.tsx)&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;@analytics (独立加载)&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;@team (独立加载)&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; E[&quot;Suspense boundary&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; F[&quot;Suspense boundary&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"DashboardLayout\"]\n    A --&gt; B[\"children (page.tsx)\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"@analytics (独立加载)\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"@team (独立加载)\"]\n    C --&gt; E[\"Suspense boundary\"]\n    D --&gt; F[\"Suspense boundary\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"intercepting-routes\">Intercepting Routes</h2><p>拦截路由允许在当前布局中显示另一个路由的内容，常用于模态框：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"app/&#10;├── feed/&#10;│   └── page.tsx&#10;├── photo/&#10;│   └── [id]/&#10;│       └── page.tsx        (独立访问的完整页面)&#10;└── feed/&#10;    └── (..)photo/&#10;        └── [id]/&#10;            └── page.tsx    (在 feed 中以模态框显示)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>app/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── feed/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── page.tsx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── photo/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── [id]/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       └── page.tsx        (独立访问的完整页面)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── feed/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    └── (..)photo/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        └── [id]/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            └── page.tsx    (在 feed 中以模态框显示)</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"// app/feed/(..)photo/[id]/page.tsx&#10;export default function PhotoModal({ params }: { params: { id: string } }) {&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;Modal&gt;&#10;      &lt;PhotoDetail id={params.id} /&gt;&#10;    &lt;/Modal&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}&#10;&#10;// app/photo/[id]/page.tsx&#10;export default function PhotoPage({ params }: { params: { id: string } }) {&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;div className=&quot;full-page&quot;&gt;&#10;      &lt;PhotoDetail id={params.id} /&gt;&#10;    &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// app/feed/(..)photo/[id]/page.tsx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export default function PhotoModal({ params }: { params: { id: string } }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;Modal></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;PhotoDetail id={params.id} /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/Modal></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// app/photo/[id]/page.tsx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export default function PhotoPage({ params }: { params: { id: string } }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;div className=\"full-page\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;PhotoDetail id={params.id} /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 拦截路由使用 <code>(.)</code> 匹配同级、<code>(..)</code> 匹配上级、<code>(..)(..)</code> 匹配上上级、<code>(...)</code> 匹配根目录的路由。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"caching\">Caching</h2><p>Next.js App Router 有多层缓存策略：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>缓存层</th>\n<th>位置</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>控制方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Request Memoization</td>\n<td>服务端</td>\n<td>同一渲染中重复 fetch 去重</td>\n<td>自动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Data Cache</td>\n<td>服务端</td>\n<td>跨请求缓存 fetch 结果</td>\n<td><code>revalidate</code> / <code>no-store</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Full Route Cache</td>\n<td>服务端</td>\n<td>缓存完整的 HTML + RSC Payload</td>\n<td>静态 vs 动态路由</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Router Cache</td>\n<td>客户端</td>\n<td>缓存已访问路由的 RSC Payload</td>\n<td><code>router.refresh()</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"// 静态缓存（默认）&#10;const data = await fetch(&#39;https://api.example.com/posts&#39;);&#10;&#10;// 定时重验证&#10;const data = await fetch(&#39;https://api.example.com/posts&#39;, {&#10;  next: { revalidate: 60 },&#10;});&#10;&#10;// 不缓存&#10;const data = await fetch(&#39;https://api.example.com/posts&#39;, {&#10;  cache: &#39;no-store&#39;,&#10;});&#10;&#10;// 按需重验证&#10;import { revalidatePath, revalidateTag } from &#39;next/cache&#39;;&#10;&#10;export async function publishArticle(formData: FormData) {&#10;  &#39;use server&#39;;&#10;  await db.article.create({&#10;    /* ... */&#10;  });&#10;  revalidatePath(&#39;/blog&#39;);&#10;  revalidateTag(&#39;articles&#39;);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 静态缓存（默认）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const data = await fetch('https://api.example.com/posts');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 定时重验证</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const data = await fetch('https://api.example.com/posts', {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  next: { revalidate: 60 },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 不缓存</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const data = await fetch('https://api.example.com/posts', {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  cache: 'no-store',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 按需重验证</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import { revalidatePath, revalidateTag } from 'next/cache';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export async function publishArticle(formData: FormData) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  'use server';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  await db.article.create({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    /* ... */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  revalidatePath('/blog');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  revalidateTag('articles');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[请求到达] --&gt; B{Router Cache 命中?}&#10;    B -- 是 --&gt; C[返回客户端缓存]&#10;    B -- 否 --&gt; D{Full Route Cache 命中?}&#10;    D -- 是 --&gt; E[返回服务端缓存 HTML]&#10;    D -- 否 --&gt; F{Data Cache 命中?}&#10;    F -- 是 --&gt; G[使用缓存数据渲染]&#10;    F -- 否 --&gt; H[fetch 远程 API]&#10;    H --&gt; I[存入 Data Cache]&#10;    I --&gt; G&#10;    G --&gt; J[存入 Full Route Cache]&#10;    J --&gt; K[返回 HTML]\">flowchart TD\n    A[请求到达] --&gt; B{Router Cache 命中?}\n    B -- 是 --&gt; C[返回客户端缓存]\n    B -- 否 --&gt; D{Full Route Cache 命中?}\n    D -- 是 --&gt; E[返回服务端缓存 HTML]\n    D -- 否 --&gt; F{Data Cache 命中?}\n    F -- 是 --&gt; G[使用缓存数据渲染]\n    F -- 否 --&gt; H[fetch 远程 API]\n    H --&gt; I[存入 Data Cache]\n    I --&gt; G\n    G --&gt; J[存入 Full Route Cache]\n    J --&gt; K[返回 HTML]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>App Router 基于 RSC，使用文件系统路由，每个路由段可定义独立的 layout、loading、error</li>\n<li><strong>Layout</strong> 跨路由保持状态，<strong>Page</strong> 定义页面内容，<strong>Loading</strong> 和 <strong>Error</strong> 处理异步状态</li>\n<li><strong>Parallel Routes</strong> 使用 <code>@slot</code> 在同一布局中并行渲染多个页面</li>\n<li><strong>Intercepting Routes</strong> 拦截导航在当前布局中以模态框等形式展示</li>\n<li>多层缓存策略（Request Memoization → Data Cache → Full Route Cache → Router Cache）提供高性能的数据获取</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Next.js App Router 应用路由","id":"next-js-app-router-应用路由"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"App Router 架构","id":"app-router-架构"},{"level":2,"text":"Layout / Page / Loading / Error","id":"layout-page-loading-error"},{"level":3,"text":"Layout","id":"layout"},{"level":3,"text":"Page","id":"page"},{"level":3,"text":"Loading","id":"loading"},{"level":3,"text":"Error","id":"error"},{"level":2,"text":"Parallel Routes","id":"parallel-routes"},{"level":2,"text":"Intercepting Routes","id":"intercepting-routes"},{"level":2,"text":"Caching","id":"caching"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"React Server Components 服务端组件","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-in-depth/server-rendering/react-server-components"},"next":{"title":"流式渲染与 Suspense","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-in-depth/server-rendering/streaming-and-suspense"}}